      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Silverleaf\"]\n\nInteresting that in the base game review he says he&#39;d have preferred minis to the tokens, and then in the expansion review he complains that the minis aren&#39;t easy to distinguish and that unless you&#39;re going to paint the tokens are better. Make up your mind Tom! ;)\n\n[/quote]\n\nActually, I completely agree &nbsp;with that sentiment.\n\nMinis are more fun than tokens, but the unpainted minis are problematic such that the (beautiful!) tokens are better, even though they&#39;re just tokens.\n\nI had been starting to fear that my money spent on the painted tokens was a waste, but after playing with the painted minis at the tournament, I am _SO_ happy I could afford to purchase them.\n",
